{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0157","paragraphs":[{"id":"pfe32c05e482b-1","text":"水调数声持酒听。"},{"id":"p17277ca11bab-1","text":"午醉醒来愁未醒。"},{"id":"p9d056d87d113-1","text":"送春春去几时回，临晚镜。"},{"id":"pd9c86b676154-1","text":"伤流景。"},{"id":"p324c337aba33-1","text":"往事後期空记省。"},{"id":"p85f8da6a6e2b-1","text":"沙上并禽池上暝。"},{"id":"p2d42185147bc-1","text":"云破月来花弄影。"},{"id":"pf2ad6e57f1db-1","text":"重重帘幕密遮灯，风不定。"},{"id":"p80b4e1cabe5a-1","text":"人初静。"},{"id":"pe8a23e48a447-1","text":"明日落红应满径。"}]}